# Breaking the Bonds of Fate (battlefield.breaking_the_bonds_of_fate#reqs, Talacca Cove): six chars at _1l0, each
# refused with NO_BATTLEFIELD_ENTRY 7376 (the framework's entry hooks) and no menu. Main (a level 75 Corsair at level
# cap 75, Breaking the Bonds of Fate accepted at Quest[6][41]Prog 1 (GMs), one Corsair's Testimony): a trigger with no
# trade (a testimony fight's registrant must trade): 7376, then the door's default (DefaultActions.lua messageSpecial
# -1, shown as 32767); a trade of the Puppetmaster's Testimony (not the required item): 7376. Each other trades a
# Corsair's Testimony, all else as main: bob a level 65 Corsair (the level alone); cat at Quest[6][41]Prog 2 (the var
# alone: the registrant's must be 1); dan with the quest available (the quest alone); eve with it completed (a
# registrant's must be accepted); fay a level 75 Warrior (the job alone).
lists TalaccaCove/_1l0/onTrade TalaccaCove/_1l0/onTrigger TalaccaCove/onEventUpdate/32000 TalaccaCove/onEventFinish/32000
char zone=TalaccaCove pos=-98.5,-9.399,-87 job=COR lvl=75
char bob zone=TalaccaCove pos=-98.5,-9.399,-87 job=COR lvl=65
char cat zone=TalaccaCove pos=-98.5,-9.399,-87 job=COR lvl=75
char dan zone=TalaccaCove pos=-98.5,-9.399,-87 job=COR lvl=75
char eve zone=TalaccaCove pos=-98.5,-9.399,-87 job=COR lvl=75
char fay zone=TalaccaCove pos=-98.5,-9.399,-87 job=WAR lvl=75
levelcap 75
quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
quest AhtUrhgan.BreakingTheBondsOfFate accepted
charvar Quest[6][41]Prog 1
item CorsairsTestimony
bob: levelcap 75
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
bob: quest AhtUrhgan.BreakingTheBondsOfFate accepted
bob: charvar Quest[6][41]Prog 1
bob: item CorsairsTestimony
cat: levelcap 75
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
cat: quest AhtUrhgan.BreakingTheBondsOfFate accepted
cat: charvar Quest[6][41]Prog 2
cat: item CorsairsTestimony
dan: levelcap 75
dan: quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
dan: charvar Quest[6][41]Prog 1
dan: item CorsairsTestimony
eve: levelcap 75
eve: quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
eve: quest AhtUrhgan.BreakingTheBondsOfFate completed
eve: charvar Quest[6][41]Prog 1
eve: item CorsairsTestimony
fay: levelcap 75
fay: quest AhtUrhgan.AgainstAllOdds completed
fay: quest AhtUrhgan.BreakingTheBondsOfFate accepted
fay: charvar Quest[6][41]Prog 1
fay: item CorsairsTestimony
item PuppetmastersTestimony
login
bob: login
cat: login
dan: login
eve: login
fay: login
trigger _1l0
finish-if-event
trade _1l0 PuppetmastersTestimony x1
finish-if-event
bob: trade _1l0 CorsairsTestimony x1
bob: finish-if-event
cat: trade _1l0 CorsairsTestimony x1
cat: finish-if-event
dan: trade _1l0 CorsairsTestimony x1
dan: finish-if-event
eve: trade _1l0 CorsairsTestimony x1
eve: finish-if-event
fay: trade _1l0 CorsairsTestimony x1
fay: finish-if-event
